<Base title="Source Policy | GameIntel"><article class="article"><p class="eyebrow">Source policy</p><h1>Permitted sources. Clear provenance.</h1><p class="lede">GameIntel uses official APIs, RSS, permitted pages and explicitly supplied fixtures. Free access is not assumed to mean unrestricted legal permission.</p><section><h2>Lineage matters</h2><p>Reposts that repeat one upstream claim are useful context but do not count as independent corroboration.</p></section><section><h2>Public citations</h2><p>Public pages expose approved citation links only. Reviewer-only URLs and unsafe source material stay outside public HTML, feeds, APIs and search indexes.</p></section></article></Base>
